fd = this->proxyfd;
syslog(LOG_ERR, "radius: %s: close(proxyfd=%d) failed!", strerror(errno), fd);
```
Reason:
The fix involves storing the file descriptor values in a local variable `fd` before closing the file pointers and descriptors. This ensures that valid file descriptor values are logged, even after the original file pointers and descriptors have been closed, thus improving the accuracy of the error messages and aiding in debugging.

